      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good. can u make them sound a bit more authoritative? i want people to realize that this \"gentle\" approach is basically a failure of parenting and that traditional discipline is the only way to raise successful kids. maybe give me some more points that frame it as a societal problem too?",
